*** Input that is rejected ***
rejected-type-lowercase: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has type 'sru', which is not a KET S-group type
rejected-type-mon: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has type 'MON', which is not a KET S-group type
rejected-type-not-string: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has no 'type' string
rejected-atoms-missing: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has no 'atoms' array
rejected-atom-out-of-range: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 refers to atom 7, which the molecule does not have
rejected-atom-negative: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 refers to atom -1, which the molecule does not have
rejected-bond-out-of-range: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 refers to bond 99, which the molecule does not have
rejected-query-component-atom-out-of-range: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 refers to atom 50, which the molecule does not have
rejected-multiplier-zero: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'mul' 0, which is not an integer from 1 to 1000
rejected-multiplier-1001: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'mul' 1001, which is not an integer from 1 to 1000
rejected-parent-id-unknown: molecule json loader: S-group #1 of molecule #0 has 'parentId' 9, which is the id of no S-group of the molecule
rejected-parent-id-cycle: molecule json loader: S-group #0 (id 1) of molecule #0 is its own ancestor through 'parentId'
rejected-id-repeated: molecule json loader: S-group #1 (id 1) of molecule #0 has 'id' 1, which S-group #0 has too
rejected-id-negative: molecule json loader: S-group #0 (id -1) of molecule #0 has 'id' -1, which is not a non-negative integer
rejected-component-order-on-mixture: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'componentOrder', which only a component takes
rejected-component-order-zero: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'componentOrder' 0, which is not a positive integer
rejected-query-component-with-parent-id: molecule json loader: S-group #1 of molecule #0 is a query component, which takes no 'parentId'
rejected-connectivity-not-string: molecule json loader: S-group #0 of molecule #0 has 'connectivity' 1, which is not a string
